{"availability":"available","full":"azlanabyssal-cloud/fraudshield","name":"fraudshield","description":"Free scam checker and first-hour guide for India. Paste a message, link or QR screenshot: it quotes the words that gave the scam away and says what to do next. Checks run on your device. Independent student project, GPREC Kurnool. Helpline 1930.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-03T10:52:57Z","updated":"2026-10-11T11:33:43Z","license":null,"branch":"master","homepage":"https://azlanabyssal-cloud.github.io/fraudshield/","topics":["awareness","community-service","cybercrime","digital-fraud","hinglish","india","javascript","mlops","on-device","privacy","pwa","scam-detection","security","web-speech-api"],"demo":"https://azlanabyssal-cloud.github.io/fraudshield/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:57.473Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:57.473Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:57.473Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:50:57.473Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An offline-first scam checker and first-hour guide for India. Paste a message, link or screenshot and it names the scam it resembles, quotes the exact words that gave it away, and says what to do next. Nothing you paste leaves your device, and every claim below is measured, labelled as a proxy, or refused.","[]( Live: azlanabyssal-cloud.github.io/fraudshield · Helpline: 1930 (free, 24×7) · Architecture · Measurements · Privacy · Decisions","Built by Azlan (B.Tech CSE, AI and ML, G. Pulla Reddy Engineering College, Kurnool) as his Community Service Project, after eight weeks going house to house and shop to shop in Balaji Nagar, Munagalapadu. Not monetised: no accounts, no analytics, no backend of its own."],"features":["Ask the assistant (floating widget on every page, or the Assistant page) in English, Hindi, or Hindi and Telugu typed in Latin letters (\"Hinglish\"): paste a message, describe what happened, or say \"money left my…","Speak instead of typing (English or Hindi). On-device where the browser supports it, so nothing leaves; otherwise only after an explicit choice that names who receives the audio (Google, Apple or Microsoft, never…","Paste a message or share a screenshot of one. It names the scam it resembles, quotes the exact words that gave it away, and says what to do next. It never says a message is genuine, only that it found no known pattern.…","Check a link or a QR code. Verdicts are scam, suspicious, unverified and official, and \"scam\" is given only on specific evidence: a hidden destination (user@host), an official name hijacked inside another domain, a…","Learn the patterns: digital arrest, UPI and QR tricks, OTP and KYC scams, investment groups, sextortion, loan apps, with the first 60 minutes after a fraud laid out step by step."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/azlanabyssal-cloud/fraudshield/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"9a19c49f514fa5da108ef789afdba62f8122e39b03a5bc3af25a6fb3ba71bee5","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:57.619Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:50:57.619Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An offline-first scam checker and first-hour guide for India. Paste a message, link or screenshot and it names the scam it resembles, quotes the exact words that gave it away, and says what to do next. Nothing you paste leaves your device, and every claim below is measured, labelled as a proxy, or refused.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/azlanabyssal-cloud/fraudshield/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Not monetised: no accounts, no analytics, no backend of its own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/azlanabyssal-cloud/fraudshield/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"9a19c49f514fa5da108ef789afdba62f8122e39b03a5bc3af25a6fb3ba71bee5","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/azlanabyssal-cloud/fraudshiel